{"title": "Memorial Portrait", "pageid": 56468, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Memorial_Portrait", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Painting_Portrait_Rectangle_J_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Painting_Portrait_Rectangle_J_Faded.png/300px-Painting_Portrait_Rectangle_J_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/2/27/Painting_Portrait_Rectangle_J_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Memorial Portrait image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Painting_Portrait_Rectangle_J_Faded.png/300px-Painting_Portrait_Rectangle_J_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Painting_Portrait_Rectangle_J_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Memory Portrait</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous#Valuable\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Valuable</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Written with care along the bottom of the frame is the epitaph <i>\"In loving memory of Michèle\"</i>.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 1.05 kg (2.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 1.05 kg (2.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 30 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  30  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>At <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-18&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-55</span>, on the wall above a small flowerbed outside the <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The \"In Remembrance\" section of the game Credits contains the name of \"Michèle Aitken\", and there are some speculations on who exactly was memorized in this way. See also: <i>Reddit: CoffeeSuccessful1575 (2025-5-18). <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/BaldursGate3/comments/1kpnwbd/anyone_know_if_this_is_a_reference_to_something/\">Anyone know if this is a reference to something?</a></i></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 254.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 252.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:RivingtonMemoryPortrait.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"The portrait on the wall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/RivingtonMemoryPortrait.png/379px-RivingtonMemoryPortrait.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/RivingtonMemoryPortrait.png/568px-RivingtonMemoryPortrait.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/RivingtonMemoryPortrait.png/757px-RivingtonMemoryPortrait.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The portrait on the wall\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/RivingtonMemoryPortrait.png/379px-RivingtonMemoryPortrait.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"253\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/RivingtonMemoryPortrait.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The portrait on the wall</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 256.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 254.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:MemoryPortrait.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"The portrait image\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/MemoryPortrait.png/382px-MemoryPortrait.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/MemoryPortrait.png/573px-MemoryPortrait.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/MemoryPortrait.png/764px-MemoryPortrait.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The portrait image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/MemoryPortrait.png/382px-MemoryPortrait.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"255\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/MemoryPortrait.png\" class=\"mw-file-sou